---
layout: base.njk
title: Personal
description: About Idris Thomas-Jones – attacking midfielder and student, Class of 2027.
permalink: /personal/
---
<h1 class="page-title">Personal</h1>

{%- set details = personal.details or [] %}
{%- if personal.bio %}
<section class="panel" data-testid="bio">
  {%- for para in personal.bio | string | trim | split("\n\n") %}
  <p>{{ para | trim }}</p>
  {%- endfor %}
</section>
{%- endif %}

{%- if details.length %}
<section class="panel">
  <dl class="details">
    {%- for d in details %}
    <div data-testid="detail"><dt>{{ d.label }}</dt><dd>{{ d.value }}</dd></div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </dl>
</section>
{%- endif %}

{%- if not personal.bio and not details.length %}
<p class="muted">More about Idris coming soon.</p>
{%- endif %}
